/// What the makers publish about each film in the catalog: its data sheet and product page on the
/// maker's own site, what the maker says the film is for, in a line of our own words, and the facts
/// its data sheet gives (speed, process, grain, base…). Gathered on the web in November 2026 and
/// checked link by link; a film whose maker publishes no data sheet says so. Only links and our own
/// summaries are kept here: no maker's document or text is copied in.
struct FilmSheet {
  /// The data sheet (a PDF on the maker's site, or its development page), and what it is called.
  let sheet: URL?
  let title: String?
  /// The maker's page for the film.
  let page: URL?
  /// What the maker says it is for and what it is like, in our words.
  let about: String
  /// Facts from the data sheet, short.
  let specs: [String]
}

